<title>UK: Alliance says 3rd auction avg price 528p/shr.</title>
<headline>Alliance says 3rd auction avg price 528p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK banking and mortgage group Alliance &amp; Leicester, which floated on Monday, said on Wednesday that the average price of shares at its third and final auction of free shares belonging to members was 528.01642 pence per share.</p>
<p>The former building society said the range of the third auction prices was between 525p and 550p per share.</p>
</text>
